{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18104410","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18104410","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"narration:0:1810441001:0":{"text":"Grezhul storms out of the Refinery.","source_cn":"格瑞泽尔勒气势汹汹地离开了炼化间","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C4C21A2B939FEF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:1:1810441002:0":{"text":"And makes his way to...","source_cn":"而他前往之处是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9950F7B16F04558D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1810441003:0":{"text":"Tephesia! Come out and face me!","source_cn":"——苔佩希！滚出来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x154D6AB8D081BD1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1810441004:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1810441005:0":{"text":"M-My apologies, Your Ladyship... I couldn't stop Commander Grezhul...","source_cn":"对、对不起，领主阁下……我没能拦住格瑞泽尔勒大人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC67B36D21BFF05F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1810441006:0":{"text":"Begone. I'll deal with you later.","source_cn":"下去吧，这笔账余往后再和你算。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBAA6F14508EB3CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1810441007:0":{"text":"I'm surprised King Thoran never taught you basic manners. Then again, perhaps you've spent so long barking like a rabid hound that you've forgotten them, Commander Grezhul.","source_cn":"托安陛下没有教导过你，不要在别人安歇之处大吵大叫吗？还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x928B300937CF4AF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1810441008:0":{"text":"Spare me the sarcasm. Care to explain the Refinery attack?","source_cn":"我不是来听你冷嘲热讽的。炼化间遭袭一事你准备怎么解释？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0ABEC3EDF9B5B1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1810441009:0":{"text":"*Chuckle*","source_cn":"呵……呵呵呵呵……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x929446A1C78BD996","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1810441010:0":{"text":"Well, well. It seems your brain was scavenged from the same dump as Radu's.","source_cn":"真是没看出来，原来你的脑子也和垃杜一样，是从乱葬岗那些...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27126ECAF867A0A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1810441011:0":{"text":"Save your interrogation tactics for those spies. The attack has nothing to do with me.","source_cn":"别拿审问间谍的把戏对付余。炼化间被袭击一事，和余没有任...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69EB1E8A4C4995EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1810441012:0":{"text":"If not you, who else could it be? The Lightbearers don't have the reach to meddle in Novaris' affairs!","source_cn":"不是你，还能是谁？耀光帝国的胳膊没那么长，伸不到诺珐斯来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CAA5A312FFC426F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1810441013:0":{"text":"If Bantus truly wants peace, it should stop making enemies of everyone it meets. Finding the culprit is your responsibility. Don't come throwing tantrums at me.","source_cn":"与班题斯结怨之人能填满十个炼化间都不止，追捕犯人是你的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C2B46D5512D014D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1810441014:0":{"text":"I'm in a good mood today, so I'll let it slide. Otherwise, I'd call off the <style=\"highlight\">plague operation in Lightbearer territory</style> immediately.","source_cn":"今日是余宽容大度，不愿与你计较。否则余必定马上叫停<s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC109B0951A4605A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1810441015:0":{"text":"Plague? Is that the story you're going with this time?","source_cn":"散播瘟疫？这就是你胡编的新借口？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x240C14D6CC90FD71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1810441016:0":{"text":"I'm not joking about the <style=\"highlight\">candle blossom plague</style>.","source_cn":"<style=highlight>赤烛蕊瘟疫</sty...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x628107630F8FF7D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1810441017:0":{"text":"I had candle blossoms distributed to those human stowaways as merchandise. Once they return to the Lightbearer Empire and remove their disguises, the real show will begin.","source_cn":"余将赤烛蕊放进了海歌剧院的纪念品里。等偷渡者返回耀光，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51071D439778438C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1810441018:0":{"text":"Now, no one should question my loyalty to Bantus. Why are you always so suspicious of me? It's not as though I've monopolized all of King Thoran's attention.","source_cn":"你瞧，余对班题斯多么忠诚。你为何总是疑心呢？余又没有抢...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B63E6D24CD19F3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1810441019:0":{"text":"Novaris and the Adamant Syndicate are both responsible for this security lapse. <style=\"highlight\">Place Novaris under lockdown immediately</style>.","source_cn":"诺珐斯和黑金商会甩不掉疏于防患的罪名，立刻下令：<st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01F7CBFB8AD483BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1810441020:0":{"text":"Hold on. What gives you the right to boss me around? Novaris is a self-governed city.","source_cn":"不好意思。你是在命令一位拥有自治权的领主吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC503CEB7D919AB21","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1810441021:0":{"text":"You're free to defy me if you believe Novaris no longer needs supplies from Bantus. Think about your people and how many replacement limbs they require each year.","source_cn":"你可以违逆，班题斯也可以切断供给诺珐斯的物资。以诺珐斯...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x109247F05C17273B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1810441022:0":{"text":"Even after thirty years, Bantus is still relying on the same old trick.","source_cn":"哈……三十年过去了，班题斯还是只会这一招。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D9B7A108BD2A564","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1810441023:1":{"text":"And it works every single time.","source_cn":"管用就好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05665A99BE2EFA71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1810441024:0":{"text":"Tell the Syndicate to stop interfering with the Soul Forge's repairs. I'll be putting <style=\"highlight\">Isabella</style> in charge from now on, so you won't be able to use your laziness as an excuse for the delays anymore.","source_cn":"让黑金的人别再插手转化器的修复工作，我会派<style...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B11BEE77B85E656","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1810441025:0":{"text":"... Wait.","source_cn":"——等等。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x868F4B6D881D9D05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1810441026:0":{"text":"As a matter of fact, I've had people investigating the Refinery attack for quite some time. We now have a few promising leads.","source_cn":"实不相瞒，余早就派人调查炼化间被袭击一事，现下调查已经...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x781D15D0708B33BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1810441027:0":{"text":"So efficient? That's out of character for you.","source_cn":"这不像你的效率。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE240D26A18AD165D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1810441028:0":{"text":"Oh, I'm still lazy. I simply have competent people working for me.","source_cn":"越是怠惰的领袖，越是需要辛勤的部下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0728BE8628A33D67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1810441029:0":{"text":"Enough. Who are the culprits?","source_cn":"别废话。犯人是谁？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x799AF5DDB412C8E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1810441030:0":{"text":"Given your earlier rude behavior, I see no reason to share that information with you.","source_cn":"鉴于你方才的失礼行径，余不想告诉你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB93F157470433D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1810441031:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1810441032:1":{"text":"Silvina.","source_cn":"西尔维娜。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C35239AA30407BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1810441033:0":{"text":"Yes, Commander.","source_cn":"在。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F6FC72CD814A2E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1810441034:0":{"text":"Stay here and listen to what Tephesia has found out. If her findings are reliable, bring the culprits to me.","source_cn":"听取苔佩希的调查结果。如果可靠，带犯人来见我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7835B9F84C1270F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1810441035:0":{"text":"Beware of any tricks, or Isabella will bear the brunt.","source_cn":"别上她的当。否则受罚的会是伊莎贝拉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12E01A87E24C8D8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1810441036:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"………………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x197F0BE8A09E0D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1810441037:0":{"text":"Must be rough working for Commander Grezhul, huh?","source_cn":"在格瑞泽尔勒卿手下不好过吧，刺客小姐？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19F7E92DB8955B97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1810441038:0":{"text":"Give me the names.","source_cn":"告诉我名字。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBF79E3D1479A3AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1810441039:1":{"text":"Would you believe me no matter who I named, Silvina?","source_cn":"无论余说是谁你都会相信吗，西尔维娜？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E3938E9FAB99EBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1810441040:0":{"text":"Just spill it.","source_cn":"快说，犯人是谁。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BFF9543E9A37E80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1810441041:0":{"text":"Have a little patience, dear. The culprit is from the Repair House...","source_cn":"呵呵，别心急嘛，犯人来自修缮屋……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x73748784E3321A9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:47:1810441042:0":{"text":"Meanwhile, at the Repair House...","source_cn":"此时，修缮屋内","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88A449091E10EE05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"Subtitles","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格瑞泽尔勒":{"text":"Grezhul","source":"格瑞泽尔勒","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:苔佩希":{"text":"Tephesia","source":"苔佩希","status":"matc